        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nUsing any custom CLI tool as an items source to pick from file system entries can be done with [`builtin.cli()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/333d2d1090c80ac936b960469a6e93982cbaeb21/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1129). Adding one more built-in source for `builtin.files()`, let alone replacing (even non-default) `fd` is out of scope. And at least at the moment `fd` seems to be much more widespread tool than `bfs`.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
